Please refer to each core's documentation for complete license information.

DISCLAIMER

pdEMU is an emulator frontend that uses libretro cores. The software does not
include any copyrighted game ROMs, BIOS files, or proprietary system files.
Users are responsible for ensuring they have legal rights to any ROM files
they use with this software.

The pdEMU developers do not condone piracy and encourage users to only use
ROM files that they legally own or that are in the public domain.
